<title>NETHERLANDS: ING TO OPEN INSURANCE OUTLET IN INDIA.</title>
<headline>ING TO OPEN INSURANCE OUTLET IN INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch financial services firm ING Group said on Wednesday its insurance arm had obtained a licence to open a representative office in the Indian capital of New Delhi.</p>
<p>&quot;When the insurance market in India will be opened to foreign insurers, ING will apply for a licence to set up a life insurance company,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The Dutch group added that it saw India with its 950 million inhabitants as an &quot;interesting potential growth market&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
